// Package pb holds the Go code generated from sensorbox.proto by protoc.sh in the repository root.
//
// The generated sensorbox.pb.go is not committed (see .gitignore), but this file is, so that the
// package also exists without it. Dependabot does not run protoc.sh; without this file its
// go mod tidy fails with "cannot find module providing package .../server/pb".
//
// Keep this file free of imports and declarations: go mod tidy must give the same result with
// and without the generated code. That holds because the generated code only imports the
// standard library and google.golang.org/protobuf, which main.go imports as well.
package pb
